### Usage Instructions
- Use the above dependencies and documentation links as a reference for development.
- Ensure that all dependencies are up-to-date by running `composer update` and `npm update`.
- Refer to the documentation links for detailed guidance on each package or tool.
- When implementing features, adhere to the project’s coding standards and best practices as defined in the Project Rules (`/.cursor/rules`).